@baseUrl = https://localhost:7081
@token = REEMPLAZAR_POR_JWT_CLIENTE
@apiKey = REEMPLAZAR_POR_API_KEY_COMERCIO
@paymentLinkId = REEMPLAZAR_POR_ID_LINK
@checkoutToken = REEMPLAZAR_POR_TOKEN_LINK
@cardId = REEMPLAZAR_POR_ID_DE_GET_ME_CARDS
@cardOrderId = REEMPLAZAR_POR_ID_PEDIDO
@destinationWalletId = REEMPLAZAR_POR_ID_BILLETERA_DESTINO
@operationKey = REEMPLAZAR_POR_UUID_Y_REUTILIZAR_AL_REINTENTAR

### Acceso público: registrar cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"dni":"30123456","firstName":"Ana","lastName":"Pérez","email":"ana@example.com","password":"Frase de prueba 2026!"}

### Acceso público: iniciar sesión
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ana@example.com","password":"Frase de prueba 2026!"}

### Cliente JWT: mi perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cliente JWT: actualizar mi perfil
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Ana María","lastName":"Pérez"}

### Cliente JWT: crear mi billetera, sin cuerpo; repetir devuelve la existente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cliente JWT: consultar saldo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cliente JWT: mis tarjetas; usar el id de una tarjeta Debit para pagar desde mi saldo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cliente JWT: pagar con tarjeta asociada. Débito descuenta saldo real de la billetera.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/payment-links/{{paymentLinkId}}/card-payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{operationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"cardId":"{{cardId}}"}

### Cliente JWT: solicitar tarjeta física con domicilio completo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/physical-card-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type":"Debit",
  "deliveryAddress":{
    "street":"Av. Corrientes",
    "number":"1234",
    "city":"CABA",
    "state":"Buenos Aires",
    "postalCode":"1043",
    "country":"Argentina"
  }
}

### Cliente JWT: estado y domicilio del pedido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/physical-card-orders/{{cardOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cliente JWT: transferencia por ID; conservar la clave de la operación
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/transfers/by-wallet-id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{operationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"destinationWalletId":"{{destinationWalletId}}","amount":300.00}

### Cliente JWT: historial paginado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/wallet/movements?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Integración: alta pública de comercio; guardar la API Key recibida
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyName":"Comercio de prueba","contactEmail":"comercio@example.com","description":"Tienda online","cuit":"30712345678"}

### Integración API Key: generar link de cobro
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/payment-links
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":300.00,"title":"Compra de prueba","currency":"ARS","ttlMinutes":30}

### Integración API Key: consultar link y cobros recibidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/payment-links/{{paymentLinkId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Integración API Key: saldo de la integración
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/wallet
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Integración API Key: cobros recibidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/received-payments?limit=20
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Checkout público: consultar un link
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/payment-links/{{checkoutToken}}

### Checkout público: obtener QR
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/payment-links/{{checkoutToken}}/qr

### Checkout con tarjeta asociada: requiere JWT e Idempotency-Key, aunque la ruta admita pagos anónimos externos
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/checkout/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{operationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{checkoutToken}}","paymentMethod":"Card","cardId":"{{cardId}}"}

### Salud pública
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Dependencias
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
